    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a space mining adventure! As the pilot of a Cosmodrill, you mine for valuable resources in space. But suddenly, pirates attack the space stations and steal the alien artifacts uncovered during excavations. Now it's up to you to find out what they're plotting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources to upgrade your drill, unlocking new abilities and allowing you to dig deeper, travel farther, and face increasingly powerful foes. Along the way, you\u2019ll discover space stations\u2014once beacons of hope, now overrun by ruthless pirates. Liberate these outposts to rest, refuel, and push your mission forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/f3f8340a0bb50b58f8748089394b915e.poster.webp?t=1755419842\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/f3f8340a0bb50b58f8748089394b915e.webp?t=1755419842\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=342 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the universe of Cosmodrill on your own terms. Where you go is entirely up to you. In the open world of Cosmodrill, there are no questmarkers telling you where to go next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drill</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drill through entire planets in search of resources and uncover the secrets hidden deep within them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use resources to upgrade your ship. Fly farther, drill deeper, and survive longer to push further into the unknown than ever before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your drill to defeat enemies, activate special abilities to triumph in battle, and liberate the space stations occupied by pirates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/452be6ee4ea2b712a19d45f1cf6b7c28.poster.webp?t=1755419842\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/452be6ee4ea2b712a19d45f1cf6b7c28.webp?t=1755419842\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1200 height=180 /></picture></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready for a space mining adventure! As the pilot of a Cosmodrill, you mine for valuable resources in space. But suddenly, pirates attack the space stations and steal the alien artifacts uncovered during excavations. Now it's up to you to find out what they're plotting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect resources to upgrade your drill, unlocking new abilities and allowing you to dig deeper, travel farther, and face increasingly powerful foes. Along the way, you\u2019ll discover space stations\u2014once beacons of hope, now overrun by ruthless pirates. Liberate these outposts to rest, refuel, and push your mission forward.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/f3f8340a0bb50b58f8748089394b915e.poster.webp?t=1755419842\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/f3f8340a0bb50b58f8748089394b915e.webp?t=1755419842\" class=\"bb_img\" width=800 height=342 /></picture></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the universe of Cosmodrill on your own terms. Where you go is entirely up to you. In the open world of Cosmodrill, there are no questmarkers telling you where to go next.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Drill</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drill through entire planets in search of resources and uncover the secrets hidden deep within them.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use resources to upgrade your ship. Fly farther, drill deeper, and survive longer to push further into the unknown than ever before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your drill to defeat enemies, activate special abilities to triumph in battle, and liberate the space stations occupied by pirates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/452be6ee4ea2b712a19d45f1cf6b7c28.poster.webp?t=1755419842\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722660/extras/452be6ee4ea2b712a19d45f1cf6b7c28.webp?t=1755419842\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1200 height=180 /></picture></span></p>",
